WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
(upbeat mariachi music)

00:00:05.343 --> 00:00:06.527
- Don't you think this apple looks cute

00:00:06.527 --> 00:00:07.680
and ripe and young?

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.736
^ Just kidding!

00:00:08.736 --> 00:00:10.260
^ This apple is old as hell.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.829
^ Due to a little something called

00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:13.291
^ controlled atmosphere storage

00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:15.520
^ apples can take a long time to ripen.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.409
^ Which means this baby apple

00:00:17.409 --> 00:00:19.403
^ could actually be over a year old.

00:00:19.403 --> 00:00:21.088
Here's the thing about cherries.

00:00:21.088 --> 00:00:23.200
^ Sometimes after a heavy rain

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.237
^ little cherries can split open.

00:00:25.237 --> 00:00:27.957
^ So cherry farmers will send big old helicopters

00:00:27.957 --> 00:00:30.208
^ to fly over their crop to air dry them

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:31.861
^ so they don't freak out and break apart.

00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:33.344
^ Take about (beep) divas.

00:00:33.344 --> 00:00:34.219
^ Am I right?

00:00:34.219 --> 00:00:36.577
Fun little fact about oranges.

00:00:36.577 --> 00:00:38.347
^ They're not always orange.

00:00:38.347 --> 00:00:39.563
^ Sometimes they're green.

00:00:39.563 --> 00:00:41.675
^ In places where it's hot all the time

00:00:41.675 --> 00:00:43.286
^ oranges will stay green

00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:45.173
^ because they only turn orange

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:46.677
^ after the weather gets cool.

00:00:46.677 --> 00:00:48.768
Might be safe to assume that strawberries

00:00:48.768 --> 00:00:50.432
are berries, right?

00:00:50.432 --> 00:00:51.083
(buzzer)

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:51.776
Wrong!

00:00:51.776 --> 00:00:52.938
^ Strawberries are actually something

00:00:52.938 --> 00:00:54.230
^ called accessory fruits which means

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:56.064
^ they were developed in areas outside

00:00:56.064 --> 00:00:57.419
^ of the fruit's ovaries.

00:00:57.419 --> 00:00:59.093
I didn't even know fruits had ovaries.

00:00:59.653 --> 00:01:00.864
Watch out!

00:01:00.864 --> 00:01:03.349
^ Grapefruits can interract with certain medications

00:01:03.349 --> 00:01:05.717
^ in ways that can be really harmful to your body.

00:01:05.717 --> 00:01:07.285
It's so scary!

00:01:07.285 --> 00:01:09.348
But it's so cute.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:10.763
Do you love bananas?

00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:11.861
Because I love bananas.

00:01:11.861 --> 00:01:14.475
^ But sadly they might be extinct in the future

00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:17.056
^ due to a little disease called tropical race 4.

00:01:17.056 --> 00:01:19.478
I could go for a nice little handsome banan.

00:01:21.288 --> 00:01:22.613
What's up baby?

00:01:22.613 --> 00:01:23.855
How you doing?

00:01:24.032 --> 00:01:27.717
(upbeat mariachi music)

